From 4db0e85415c9b50158641d639f3ed763f3024cdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Giuseppe Maggio <jertlok@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:38:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 60/68] libcamera: camera_sensor_properties: Add imx179 and
 imx362

Sony IMX179 and IMX362, the front and rear sensors of the Google Pixel
2 XL. Both have 1.4um pixels, per the pixel size in the vendor sensor
libraries (libmmcamera_imx179.so, libmmcamera_imx362.so). The IMX362
test pattern menu follows the SMIA register values the driver exposes.

Assisted-by: Claude
Signed-off-by: Giuseppe Maggio <jertlok@proton.me>
---
 .../sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp       | 42 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 42 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp b/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
index 28043150e..68865d54f 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
@@ -183,6 +183,16 @@ const CameraSensorProperties *CameraSensorProperties::get(const std::string &sen
 				.hblankDelay = 2
 			},
 		} },
+		{ "imx179", {
+			.unitCellSize = { 1400, 1400 },
+			.testPatternModes = {},
